title: "Lunaris"
message: >-
  If you use Lunaris (or its ST-LRPS surrogate-gravity model) in scientific work,
  please cite the repository and associated publications. To cite a specific
  algorithm or physical model implemented by Lunaris, use its primary source in
  references/references.bib (indexed by docs/ALGORITHM_CATALOG.md), not this file.
